<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>TrackGuard AI | Railway Track Defect Detection</title>

<!-- Tailwind CSS -->
<script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
<!-- Tailwind Typography plugin -->
<script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com?plugins=typography"></script>
<!-- Font Awesome -->
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 text-gray-800">

<!-- HEADER + NAVIGATION -->
<header class="bg-slate-900 text-white sticky top-0 z-10">
  <nav class="container mx-auto flex flex-wrap justify-between items-center p-4">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-train-subway text-amber-400"></i> TrackGuard AI</h1>
    <ul class="hidden md:flex gap-6 font-medium ml-auto">
      <li><a href="#features" class="hover:text-amber-400">Features</a></li>
      <li><a href="#how-it-works" class="hover:text-amber-400">How It Works</a></li>
      <li><a href="#users" class="hover:text-amber-400">Who It's For</a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact" class="hover:text-amber-400">Contact</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>
</header>

<main>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="bg-slate-800 text-white text-center py-20 px-4">
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">AI-Based Railway Track Defect Detection &amp; Risk Prediction</h2>
    <p class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg mb-8">
      TrackGuard AI analyzes track images and video using computer vision to detect cracks,
      fractures, and surface damage — flagging high-risk sections before they become critical.
    </p>
    <a href="#features" class="bg-amber-400 text-slate-900 font-bold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-amber-300 transition">
      Explore Features
    </a>
  </section>

  <!-- AI/ML FEATURES -->
  <section id="features" class="container mx-auto py-16 px-4">
    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-800 text-center mb-10">AI/ML Features</h2>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <article class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow p-6 border-t-4 border-amber-400">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass text-amber-500 text-2xl mb-3"></i>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-2">Track Crack Detection</h3>
        <p>Computer vision models scan track imagery to identify cracks and fractures early.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow p-6 border-t-4 border-amber-400">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-eye text-amber-500 text-2xl mb-3"></i>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-2">Surface-Defect Detection</h3>
        <p>Detects surface damage and misalignment using OpenCV/YOLO-based image analysis.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow p-6 border-t-4 border-amber-400">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group text-amber-500 text-2xl mb-3"></i>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-2">Defect Classification</h3>
        <p>Classifies detected defects by type, helping prioritize the right maintenance response.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow p-6 border-t-4 border-amber-400">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation text-amber-500 text-2xl mb-3"></i>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-2">Severity / Risk Scoring</h3>
        <p>Each defect is scored for severity, giving inspectors a clear urgency ranking.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow p-6 border-t-4 border-amber-400">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line text-amber-500 text-2xl mb-3"></i>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-2">Track-Section Risk Prediction</h3>
        <p>Predicts which track sections are most likely to need urgent inspection.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow p-6 border-t-4 border-amber-400">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-bell text-amber-500 text-2xl mb-3"></i>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-2">Automatic Maintenance Alerts</h3>
        <p>Sends alerts to maintenance teams the moment a high-risk defect is detected.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
  <section id="how-it-works" class="bg-white py-16 px-4">
    <div class="container mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-800 text-center mb-10">How It Works</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-center">
        <article>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 mx-auto flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-800 text-white font-bold mb-3">1</div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Upload Track Footage</h3>
          <p class="text-sm">Images or video from inspection cameras are uploaded or streamed to the platform.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 mx-auto flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-800 text-white font-bold mb-3">2</div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">AI Detects Defects</h3>
          <p class="text-sm">Computer vision models identify, classify, and score the severity of defects.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 mx-auto flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-800 text-white font-bold mb-3">3</div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Dashboard Shows Risk</h3>
          <p class="text-sm">Risky sections and maintenance priorities appear on a live dashboard.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TARGET USERS (uses Tailwind Typography plugin via 'prose') -->
  <section id="users" class="container mx-auto py-16 px-4">
    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-800 text-center mb-10">Who It's For</h2>
    <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <blockquote>
        Built for railway maintenance teams, safety inspectors, railway engineers,
        railway authorities, and track-management organizations who need faster,
        more reliable defect detection than manual inspection alone.
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CONTACT -->
  <section id="contact" class="bg-white py-16 px-4">
    <div class="container mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-4">Contact Us</h2>
      <p>Interested in TrackGuard AI for your rail network? Get in touch with our team.</p>
      <p class="mt-2 flex items-center justify-center gap-6 flex-wrap">
        <span><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope text-amber-500 mr-1"></i> trackguard@railtech.example</span>
        <span><i class="fa-solid fa-phone text-amber-500 mr-1"></i> +91 98765 43210</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

<!-- FOOTER -->
<footer class="bg-slate-900 text-white text-center py-8">
  <p>&copy; 2026 TrackGuard AI. All rights reserved.</p>
  <p class="text-sm mt-1">Built with HTML5 &amp; Tailwind CSS</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
